# Keep the Docker build context small and free of local secrets/state.
#
# Audit M-39: without this file the ENTIRE server/ directory was uploaded to
# the Docker daemon on every build — including server/node_modules (hundreds
# of MB), any local server/.env (real Razorpay / Supabase / Resend secrets)
# and server/data/ (the JSON account store). None of those are copied into the
# final image, but they are transmitted, can land in builder cache layers and
# are visible to any build-time hook or remote builder.
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
data
tests
.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.md
